WEBVTT

00:00:00.433 --> 00:00:02.467
Are you a SMART fella...

00:00:02.467 --> 00:00:04.533
or a FART smella?

00:00:04.533 --> 00:00:06.800
Let's find OUT!

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:10.333
Question two, a number series!

00:00:10.333 --> 00:00:12.467
Three, six, twelve,

00:00:12.467 --> 00:00:14.500
twenty-four, and then...

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:15.867
what comes next?

00:00:15.867 --> 00:00:18.200
A, thirty-six... B,

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:20.600
forty-eight... C, thirty...

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:22.500
or D, forty-two?

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:24.033
Five seconds!

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:32.133
TIME'S UP! Pencils down!

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:35.133
It's... B, forty-eight!

00:00:35.133 --> 00:00:37.133
Each number simply doubles:

00:00:37.133 --> 00:00:39.333
three, six, twelve,

00:00:39.333 --> 00:00:41.233
twenty-four... and twenty-four

00:00:41.233 --> 00:00:43.833
times two is forty-eight!

00:00:44.833 --> 00:00:47.300
Question ten! Which one does NOT

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:50.300
belong? Add... subtract...

00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:53.267
multiply... number. A,

00:00:53.267 --> 00:00:56.067
add... B, subtract...

00:00:56.333 --> 00:00:59.067
C, multiply... or D,

00:00:59.067 --> 00:01:01.700
number? Five seconds!

00:01:07.367 --> 00:01:09.900
TIME'S UP! Pencils down!

00:01:10.267 --> 00:01:12.800
It's... D, number!

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:15.467
Add, subtract, and multiply are

00:01:15.467 --> 00:01:16.767
all things you do.

00:01:16.767 --> 00:01:17.733
But a number?

00:01:17.733 --> 00:01:20.033
That's the thing you do them to!

00:01:20.933 --> 00:01:23.400
Last one, question fifteen,

00:01:23.400 --> 00:01:24.833
a number puzzle,

00:01:24.833 --> 00:01:26.267
and it's sneaky!

00:01:26.267 --> 00:01:28.667
If four plus five makes twenty,

00:01:28.667 --> 00:01:30.967
three plus six makes eighteen,

00:01:30.967 --> 00:01:33.767
and two plus seven makes fourteen...

00:01:33.767 --> 00:01:36.567
then five plus four makes...

00:01:36.567 --> 00:01:38.967
what? A, nine...

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:41.300
B, eighteen... C,

00:01:41.300 --> 00:01:42.900
twenty... or D,

00:01:42.900 --> 00:01:45.333
twenty-five? Five seconds!

00:01:50.800 --> 00:01:53.333
TIME'S UP! Pencils down!

00:01:53.633 --> 00:01:55.100
The answer is...

00:01:55.100 --> 00:01:57.533
C, twenty! Here's the trick:

00:01:57.533 --> 00:02:00.833
that plus sign secretly means multiply.

00:02:00.833 --> 00:02:02.633
Four times five is twenty,

00:02:02.633 --> 00:02:05.733
so five times four is twenty too!

00:02:06.767 --> 00:02:09.700
So, are you smart or fart?

00:02:09.700 --> 00:02:11.467
Count up your correct answers to

00:02:11.467 --> 00:02:13.100
find your rank!

00:02:14.033 --> 00:02:15.533
So, how did you do?

00:02:15.533 --> 00:02:16.967
Comment your score below,

00:02:16.967 --> 00:02:18.633
and follow for more!
